        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Want to stay on top of the science and politics driving biotech today?&#xa0;<a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/signup/readout/\">Sign up</a>&#xa0;to get our biotech newsletter in your inbox.</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good morning. Many people may be taking off work this holiday week, but we&#x2019;ve got major M&amp;A news, and the FDA is as busy as ever. Let&#x2019;s get to it.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-sanofi-to-buy-insmed-for-41b-picking-up-two-lung-disease-medicines\">Sanofi to buy Insmed for $41B, picking up two lung disease medicines</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sanofi is buying the biotech Insmed for $41 billion, the companies said this morning, the largest biopharma acquisition in years.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/24/biotech-news-roche-potential-breast-cancer-blockbluster-drug-wins-second-fda-nod/?utm_campaign=rss\">Continue to STAT+ to read the full story&hellip;</a></p>"
